uma Cantina (RNG pick idx 3 of 21). Folder = this dir. Deliverable html in parent root.\n## Plan of work (mark [x] when done)\n- [ ] 1 skeleton: build.mjs, tests/run.mjs, game.js boot\n- [ ] 2 sim core + tools + ops + bot (src/sim, src/content/ops)\n- [ ] 3 view: field, hands, hud, op stage\n- [ ] 4 audio: voice, sfx, songs\n- [ ] 5 story/busts/sets, menus, settings, pause, dev, attract, touch gate, about\n- [ ] 6 consult couch + hub session\n- [ ] 7 tests, build, exit-interview.json, final reply\n## Notes\nEOF\ngrep -n 'export declare function model\\|interface ModelDef\\|interface Song\\b\\|interface SoundDef\\|class Hud\\|measure(' API.md pixel-engine.d.ts | head -30; ls types | head"}}}
