{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkiVHo6oo1i3gHGUkkdW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The three skipped items are now done, with one gap left: one prop and the second table of Op 3 got no 1080p review shot. The browser checks still pass (31/31) and so do all 5 AI Hub harness scenarios (5/5). I did not re-run the Node sim and campaign tests, since none of the changes touch the sim.\n\n- **3D comm bust:** the pixel-art portrait is replaced by a real 3D bust of whoever is speaking, anchored top-left under the camera, with its blink, brows, mouth and emotion driven by the voice. Its shadows are off, as the plan asks. The NO SIGNAL case in Op 9 shows no bust.\n- **Live monitor and mirror:** the OR-7 monitor now shows a live `RenderView` of the table. The scrub room has a real `Mirror`.\n- **1080p review:** I captured 1920×1080 shots of all 10 arenas, 8 story sets (episodes 1–7 and 9), and the bust close-up in each of those episodes. The shots are in `check/r-*.png`. I looked at the four most informative ones: Op 9, Op 10, the Ep 4 bust close-up and the Ep 6 scrub-room set. They read well; the Op 9 and Op 10 arenas were the least polished, and I left them as they are.\n\nI rebuilt the single HTML in the work folder root. It is byte-identical to `dist/game.html`, which is what the tests ran against. The Source Information, Testing, Engine and Prompt Feedback in my last message still apply, except that the comm-strip portrait is no longer a pixel face and the RenderView/Mirror touches are no longer skipped.\n\nRemaining gaps:\n- The bust and monitor/mirror screenshots were spot-looked at, not exhaustively judged.\n- Models are still code primitives rather than the engine's `model()` format, so `check.mjs --sheets` doesn't apply.\n- I did not shoot the two remaining sets (office and corridor in episodes 8 and 10) as separate review shots."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":369,"cache_read_input_tokens":532514,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":369},"output_tokens":673,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"75cb47e1-b6a0-4fd4-af20-38b42f9600a5","uuid":"b90ff87b-1d46-4e32-992c-5344bc084706","timestamp":"2026-11-06T00:19:35.263Z","request_id":"req_011CgkiVHVWGiRSTqNphhFsJ"}
