{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkjRkuGPW7u9dw5J9rXF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Everything the stop hook flagged is now done, and I checked it from the 1080p screenshots rather than assuming it.\n\n- **Models:** the hand, all 8 instruments plus dressing, and a bust and a full-body figure for each of the 11 speaking cast members are now engine `model()` data, in `src/content/models/index.js`. `check.mjs --sheets` draws all 32 models with 0 problems and only minor warnings: floating parts, thin rods, z-fighting. The runtime views build them from this data, with named pivots for the forceps jaws, plunger, laser beam, scanner disc, and the bust's brows, lids, mouth, sweat and blush. Character colours are applied as hex bindings.\n- **Review shots:** I opened screenshots at 1920×1080 of all 10 arenas, all story sets, and the busts for episodes 1–10 and the ending. The tabbed table view of Op 3 was only shot at 1080p before the model rebuild and was not re-opened afterwards; the Op 3 arena shot was opened. A few shots show a blink caught mid-frame, which is normal.\n- **Fixes from the review:** the ending scene was still raining after \"the rain has stopped\", so I removed the rain there. The ward's rain was falling indoors, so I removed that too.\n- **Tests:** content 2154/2154, audio 168/168, browser 31/31, AI Hub harness 5/5. I did not re-run the sim and campaign suites; nothing I changed this round touches the sim, and they passed in the earlier full run (2502 checks across all suites).\n\nThe HTML in the work folder root is identical to `dist/game.html`, and `exit-interview.json` is in the same folder. The Source Information and the testing, engine and prompt feedback from my first message still apply."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":239,"cache_read_input_tokens":591068,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":239},"output_tokens":589,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"75cb47e1-b6a0-4fd4-af20-38b42f9600a5","uuid":"abec2e07-7f2f-4715-b367-9c09c3f950a4","timestamp":"2026-11-06T00:31:53.675Z","request_id":"req_011CgkjRkYC2uqajSFysUjmW"}
