{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgkk5ZykYmtRekPmPx4rh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The field entities, the strain bodies and the OR-7 set props are now engine `model()` data. The full suite ran after the last edits to the code and `PROGRESS.md`, and it passes.\n\n- **What moved to `model()` data:**\n  - **Field entities:** hooks, props, tumour, sprigs, the strain core, clamps, bone fragments, the kidney, Wrath plates and eye, the Miserere core with its halo, and the hint marker.\n  - **OR-7 set props:** the operating table with its draped patient, the lamp, the instrument tray and the monitor stand.\n  - `check.mjs --sheets` draws all 53 models in the project with no errors, only minor warnings.\n- **Kidney colour:** the donor kidney now tweens from grey-plum to warm red when the artery is unclamped. The plan describes this payoff and I had not implemented it before; it was not checked in a screenshot.\n- **Screenshots:** I opened the bone-fragment arena (Op 4) and the OR-7 set from the new `model()` data at 1080p, and both render correctly. I shot the Op 6 kidney stage but did not open the image, so the colour tween has not been seen on screen.\n- **Tests:** the full command passes 2516/2516 against the final HTML. That covers the sim, the whole-campaign playthrough, content, audio, network codec, browser checks and the AI Hub harness.\n\nWhat's still not `model()` data: the room shells (floors and walls), the Kenney furniture props, and the tissue surface itself. The kit's furniture props are already engine models, the tissue is a runtime-painted canvas texture, and the room shells are plain box geometry.\n\nThe HTML in the work folder root is identical to `dist/game.html`, and `exit-interview.json` is beside it. The Source Information and testing, engine and prompt feedback from my first message still apply."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":267,"cache_read_input_tokens":621824,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":267},"output_tokens":615,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"75cb47e1-b6a0-4fd4-af20-38b42f9600a5","uuid":"bf439ddd-46a6-4221-b68e-41a362ef521a","timestamp":"2026-11-06T00:40:26.495Z","request_id":"req_011Cgkk5ZdRMocEN4i41u9qQ"}
