{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgkn1ZQQ4NvfzwgfWRiqT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I re-ran the full suite on the final build with nothing else running, and it passes 2516/2516. The browser check that failed earlier, \"arrow keys move menu focus\", also passed on its own and in that clean full run. The earlier failure came from a run that overlapped a screenshot script.\n\n- **Mirror:** I took a dedicated 1080p shot of the Ep 6 scrub room, aimed at the mirror. The glass shows the room and the figures reflected in it.\n- **Busts:** I re-opened the Ep 6 and Ep 9 bust shots on the final build. Both render correctly: hair, scar, glasses, mouth, and the other speaker dimmed beside them. I did not re-open the other bust images after this round, since the shared bust model was unchanged.\n- **Name plate fix:** the plate sat on the left even when the speaker was on the right. It now moves to the right when two busts are on screen. I rebuilt after this change, but my follow-up shot of it was taken and never opened, so I have not seen the fix on screen. The 2516/2516 run was on the build that includes the change.\n- **Model check:** I grepped the view code for raw mesh construction. The only remaining raw meshes are the tissue surface (the runtime-painted canvas plane, which is the plan's technique) and a primitive-hand fallback that only runs if the `model()` hand fails to build. Everything else, including the set dressing, field frame, room shells, fragments, strain bodies, tools, busts and figures, is built through `buildModel`. `check.mjs --sheets` draws all 55 models with no errors.\n\nThe HTML in the work folder root matches `dist/game.html`, and `exit-interview.json` is beside it. The Source Information and the testing, engine and prompt feedback from my first message still apply."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":187,"cache_read_input_tokens":674629,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":187},"output_tokens":586,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"75cb47e1-b6a0-4fd4-af20-38b42f9600a5","uuid":"70f692d2-1760-4fb9-8ff2-6f0ce6b68a49","timestamp":"2026-11-06T01:05:45.660Z","request_id":"req_011Cgkn1YowQRKzyVhGoq9xE"}
