{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QvunkhX34fLzo3vMR7WYXN","type":"tool_result","content":"542:**The tissue canvas** is the game's signature. Each table has a 480×270 RGBA `DataTexture` on a 192×108 `PlaneGeometry` in `toonMaterial(PALETTE.white, { map })` with `receiveShadow`.\n576:**The hand and instruments.** Each is `model()` data with the tip at the origin, pointing −Z. A gloved hand plus forearm from below the frame sells first-person presence, and its cast shadow gives depth ✔.\n853:2. **One great op.** Sim core, tissue canvas, hand and tools, HUD, Drain, Forceps, Suture, Gel, Syringe, Op 1 playable on pad, mouse and keys. Make this feel wonderful before moving on.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"75cb47e1-b6a0-4fd4-af20-38b42f9600a5","uuid":"5310c3f3-dcda-4932-923d-0f8cf3e444af","timestamp":"2026-11-06T01:13:28.206Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"542:**The tissue canvas** is the game's signature. Each table has a 480×270 RGBA `DataTexture` on a 192×108 `PlaneGeometry` in `toonMaterial(PALETTE.white, { map })` with `receiveShadow`.\n576:**The hand and instruments.** Each is `model()` data with the tip at the origin, pointing −Z. A gloved hand plus forearm from below the frame sells first-person presence, and its cast shadow gives depth ✔.\n853:2. **One great op.** Sim core, tissue canvas, hand and tools, HUD, Drain, Forceps, Suture, Gel, Syringe, Op 1 playable on pad, mouse and keys. Make this feel wonderful before moving on.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01QvunkhX34fLzo3vMR7WYXN","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgknc3uLvPTeTZHxDeFAX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The tissue is a texture on a plane, as PLAN.md specifies, so I made no further change. I read the text directly rather than from memory:\n\n- **Tissue (PLAN.md line 542):** \"The tissue canvas is the game's signature. Each table has a 480×270 RGBA `DataTexture` on a 192×108 `PlaneGeometry` in `toonMaterial(PALETTE.white, { map })` with `receiveShadow`.\" The plan itself prescribes a painted texture on a plane for the tissue, and that is what I built. I used a canvas texture rather than `DataTexture`.\n- **`model()` data (PLAN.md line 576):** the plan says \"The hand and instruments. Each is `model()` data\". The hand and tools are `model()` data. I also converted the busts, figures, props, room shells and set dressing, which goes beyond what the plan strictly requires.\n- **Room geometry:** the room shells are a parametric `model()` def (`roomDef` in `src/content/models/index.js`), used by every story set. I found no plan line that asks for the tissue plane to be `model()` data.\n\nThe AI Hub and `model()`-sheet checks pass with no errors. The full suite passes 2516/2516 on the build in the work folder root, which is identical to `dist/game.html`. `exit-interview.json` is beside the HTML, and the earlier Source Information and feedback sections still apply."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":647,"cache_read_input_tokens":691503,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":647},"output_tokens":464,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"75cb47e1-b6a0-4fd4-af20-38b42f9600a5","uuid":"ee241e64-e81c-48f4-867b-c8dafc440eb0","timestamp":"20