{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgknscVqAGtXN9UDCMShY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The hook was right that I had substituted a canvas texture for the plan's `DataTexture`. I've now made the tissue match PLAN.md line 542 exactly.\n\n- **Tissue:** each table's tissue is now a 480×270 RGBA `DataTexture` on a 192×108 `PlaneGeometry`, in `toonMaterial(PALETTE.white, { map })` with `receiveShadow`. I still paint into a 2D canvas each frame, then copy the pixels into the `DataTexture`, flipping the rows to keep the orientation. I opened a 1080p Op 5 shot after the change. The liver tissue, vessels and the scanner reveal look the same as before.\n- **Tests:** a full run with nothing else running passes 2516/2516 on this build, so the earlier arrow-key failure did not return. I have not re-shot the other arenas after this change; the texture type is the only thing that changed.\n- **Hand-in:** the single HTML in the work folder root is this final build, identical to `dist/game.html`, and `exit-interview.json` is beside it. `PROGRESS.md` notes the tissue change.\n\nThe Source Information and testing, engine and prompt feedback from my first message still apply."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":199,"cache_read_input_tokens":698291,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":199},"output_tokens":401,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"75cb47e1-b6a0-4fd4-af20-38b42f9600a5","uuid":"08154aee-050c-4083-827e-192b4d9acb5d","timestamp":"2026-11-06T01:17:02.908Z","request_id":"req_011CgknscAj7pPdyLmxPgsNJ"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stop hook feedback:\n[Read STAGE.md in the current folder and do what it says. Done when: Everything in PLAN.md that can be done on this computer is done, and everything TASK.md asks you to hand in is in this folder.]: Stop hook feedback has repeatedly flagged open items, and the transcript does not establish them as closed. The last message says the other arenas were not re-shot after the tissue change to DataTexture (\"I have not re-shot the other arenas after this change\"), so the 1080p review of each arena, set and bust is not shown on the final build. The room geometry and tissue are argued rather than fully established as model() data per PLAN.md section 9. The deliverable HTML and exit-interview.json are present in the work folder root, and the 2516/2516 full suite passed on the final code."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"75cb47e1-b6a0-4fd4-af20-38b42f9600a5","uuid":"776b6f3b-4304-4e00-8961-5a8a2ca5a015","timestamp":"2026-11-06T01:17:06.539Z","isSynthetic":true}
