{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkoAaahvNEUvcswPFFQi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I re-shot every arena on the final DataTexture build and opened all of them.\n\n- **Arenas:** I captured Ops 1–10 at 1080p and looked at them in three montages, plus the Op 3 tables B and C. Every arena renders correctly with the new texture:\n  - Forearm hooks with arrows (Op 1)\n  - The stomach with the swallowed key and card (Op 2)\n  - Op 3's three tables\n  - The bone fragments (Op 4)\n  - The liver and eggs (Op 5)\n  - The pink kidney (Op 6)\n  - The lung's closed eyes (Op 7)\n  - The heart's ring of plates (Op 8)\n  - The chest cysts (Op 9)\n  - The spine with a bust and lit marker (Op 10)\n\n  Orientation, dithering, vessels and overlays all match the earlier canvas version. The Op 3 table views (B hooks and gel, C scalpel guide) show correctly.\n- **Sets and busts:** the story sets and busts were re-shot and reviewed on the build before the tissue change. That change only affected the operating field, so they are unchanged. I did not re-shoot them after the tissue change.\n- **Tests:** the full suite passed 2516/2516 on this same build. Nothing has changed since, so I did not re-run it.\n- **`model()` data:** the hand, tools, busts, figures, field entities, strain bodies, set props, set dressing, room shells and the field drapes are all `model()` data. The tissue is the plan's own `DataTexture` on a `PlaneGeometry`, not `model()` data.\n\nThe single HTML in the work folder root is the final build, identical to `dist/game.html`, and `exit-interview.json` is beside it. The Source Information and testing, engine and prompt feedback from my first message still apply."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9271,"cache_read_input_tokens":699445,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_