{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkoFu7a61TxZcQmqhwzk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Every arena, set and bust is now shot on the current build (rebuilt 18:13) and opened. The set and bust shots were taken at 18:18 and 18:19, after that build, so my earlier statement that they weren't re-shot was wrong. I found the files from the same run that shot the arenas, but only opened the arena montages last time.\n\n- **Arenas:** Ops 1–10 plus Op 3 tables B and C, reviewed in the previous message.\n- **Sets:** episodes 1–10 and the ending. Rain falls in the rooftop and office scenes but is off in the ward and the ending, and the OR-7 lamp, monitor and table render on the model-based props.\n- **Busts:** episodes 1, 6, 9, 10 and the ending, plus Ep 8's set, all fine:\n  - Each name plate sits under the speaking bust.\n  - Hair, scar, glasses and mouth draw correctly.\n  - The Ep 8 bust, a bust-only camera shot, was not captured separately this time. The Ep 8 set shot above covers the room, but I didn't open a close-up of it.\n- **Tests:** 2516/2516 passed on this same code, which has not changed since.\n\nThe single HTML in the work folder root is the final build, identical to `dist/game.html`, and `exit-interview.json` is beside it. The Source Information and testing, engine and prompt feedback from my first message still apply."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11945,"cache_read_input_tokens":710192,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11945},"output_tokens":465,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"75cb47e1-b6a0-4fd4-af20-38b42f9600a5","uuid":"20e25a59-2491-4947-8335-2daa21f23a07","timestamp":"2026-11-06T01:22:0