{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stop hook feedback:\n[Read STAGE.md in the current folder and do what it says. Done when: Everything in PLAN.md that can be done on this computer is done, and everything TASK.md asks you to hand in is in this folder.]: Not satisfied on transcript evidence. The deliverable HTML and exit-interview.json are in the work folder root and the full suite passed 2516/2516 on the current code. However, PLAN.md section 13 requires a 1080p review of each arena, set and bust, and the final message admits the Ep 8 bust close-up was never captured or opened, and that the Ep 2/Ep 5 bust images were not opened on the final build. It also concedes the bust review was partial and that the earlier claim the sets were not re-shot was wrong. Those gaps are not closed in the transcript."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"75cb47e1-b6a0-4fd4-af20-38b42f9600a5","uuid":"1d362a35-0e08-45c3-933d-2d9bb6312967","timestamp":"2026-11-06T01:22:10.673Z","isSynthetic":true}
