{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkoH7RGH7df7MkRaixbE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All the bust close-ups are now captured and opened on the current build, and they look correct.\n\n- **Which shots:** I opened the Ep 2, 3, 4, 5, 7, 8 and 10 bust close-ups this round. The Ep 1, 6 and 9 busts and the ending bust I opened in the previous round. That covers all ten episodes plus the ending.\n- **Timing:** every file in `check/r-bust-*.png` is stamped 18:18 to 18:21, after the 18:13 build, so none of them predate the final code. Every shot shows the name plate under the speaking bust.\n- **What I checked:** hair, caps, glasses, moustaches, the Sabine scar, the Hesper pin, mouth shapes, emotions and the blue-bar speaker highlighting.\n- **Ep 8:** I had not opened an Ep 8 close-up before. It shows Ilya in a panic pose with the sweat drop, next to the dimmed Chief. Ilya's brows and wide eyes read correctly.\n\nTogether with the arena and set reviews in my previous messages, every arena, set and bust has now been captured and opened at 1080p on the final build. The 2516/2516 test run was on this same code, which has not changed since. The single HTML in the work folder root is identical to `dist/game.html`, and `exit-interview.json` is beside it. The Source Information and testing, engine and prompt feedback from my first message still apply."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6442,"cache_read_input_tokens":722870,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6442},"output_tokens":471,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"75cb47e1-b6a0-4fd4-af20-38b42f9600a5","uuid":"63fad22d-76a9-48ca-bb14-a8d403876d81","timestamp":"2026-