{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgkq1NMUiheFpstcoYRau","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A second full run on the same final build also passed 2516/2516, so the suite has now passed on it twice in a row.\n\n- **Test runs on this build:** the first full run, taken right after the input fix and while other agents' browsers were running on this machine, passed 2516/2516. The second run just now, on the unchanged build, passed 2516/2516 as well. The two failures I reported earlier came from the input bug that has since been fixed.\n- **Review pass:** I ran the 1080p review as one pass on the final build. It produced 34 images, covering all arenas including the three Op 3 tables, all story sets and all busts. I opened every one of them.\n- **Tissue:** PLAN.md line 542 specifies the tissue as a `DataTexture` on a `PlaneGeometry`, which is what it is now. The plan applies `model()` data to the hand and instruments (line 576), and I applied it to the busts, figures, props, room shells and set dressing as well. I found no plan line that asks for `model()` data for the tissue.\n- **Hand-in:** the single HTML in the work folder root is identical to `dist/game.html`, and `exit-interview.json` is beside it.\n\nThe Source Information and testing, engine and prompt feedback from my first message still apply. The one addition is that testing also caught the lost-key-press bug."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":176,"cache_read_input_tokens":768539,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":176},"output_tokens":428,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"75cb47e1-b6a0-4fd4-af20-38b42f9600a5","uuid":"31794974-7b22-4dd4-96e9-db3baaad23c9